My background in pharmacy and biomedical research has shaped how I approach technical challenges: start with the underlying problem, understand the evidence, and build solutions that are useful beyond the screen.
I’m particularly interested in pharmaceutical data science, pharmacometrics, clinical research, and scientific software engineering.
Whether I’m analysing biological data, exploring quantitative models, or developing an application, my goal is the same: translate complex information into something useful, reliable, and actionable.
